<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy asking for mark/lira prices.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy asking for mark/lira prices.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy was asking for mark/lira prices above 998 lire per mark, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The dealers said the lira had opened weaker and the central bank had asked for prices after the Italian currency sank through the 998 lire level.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
</text>
